{
  "schema": "vellum.parity.corpus.v1",
  "corpus_id": "pulp-host-sdk-consumer-v1",
  "description": "Host-compatibility corpus for sterile SDK consumers (G build-mode rows G3 installed find_package(Pulp), G4 released `pulp sdk install`). Loaded with --lane-module tools/parity/lanes/host.py. An out-of-tree consumer project builds PulpGain (no editor), SpectralLab and SpectralLab B (GPU-host editors, 820x560) against the SDK under test; bundles are hosted in one process (AU registered in-process only). The standalone swap control's `other.app` root is any other GPU-editor app (calibration used Pulp's in-tree SuperConvolver.app).",
  "declared_gaps": [
    {
      "row": "auval (AU v2 validator)",
      "reason": "auval only sees components registered in ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components; this lane never installs into a system plug-in folder. AU load/editor/audio are covered in-process through AudioComponentRegister."
    },
    {
      "row": "clap-validator",
      "reason": "not installed on the measuring host (command -v clap-validator: absent; control: command -v auval resolves)."
    },
    {
      "row": "LV2",
      "reason": "no Pulp example builds an LV2 bundle (zero lv2_entry.cpp under examples/; only tools/templates carry one)."
    },
    {
      "row": "REAPER daw-smoke",
      "reason": "REAPER not installed on the measuring host; opt-in per Pulp daw-smoke policy."
    },
    {
      "row": "editor_prewarm",
      "reason": "no Pulp example overrides Processor::editor_prewarm(), so the request is a no-op in every bundle; the host cannot observe the static-initializer install from outside the plug-in image."
    },
    {
      "row": "G column A (audio-only, format-core only)",
      "reason": "pulp_add_plugin links the full pulp::format stack: an editor-less PulpGain image is 44 MB and carries Skia (14038 Sk symbols), Dawn wgpu (276) and the libwgpu_native load command, so the no-editor cases here are column B-without-editor, not column A. Column A needs a format-core-only consumer, which the SDK's pulp_add_plugin does not offer."
    },
    {
      "row": "G columns C and D",
      "reason": "no Vellum provider package exists yet (V-package), so there is no Vellum-provider build and no downgrade request to make."
    },
    {
      "row": "editor-less standalone screenshot",
      "reason": "PulpGain.app (no editor) ignores PULP_SCREENSHOT and runs as a console host until killed (measured: timeout 90 s, exit 124), so no standalone case for it; the standalone swap control uses the in-tree SuperConvolver.app as the 'other app' root (a control input only)."
    }
  ],
  "declared_exceptions": [],
  "cases": [
